# Hybrid slab reference values
# 
# Configuration: eikonal 1-D Purkinje + monodomain 3-D myocardium
# Coupler: eikonalMonodomainPvjCoupler
#
# Purkinje 1-D eikonal (Dijkstra) activation times at key nodes.
# These are identical to the pure eikonal case since the 1D solver is eikonal.
# Differences from monodomain case arise from how the coupling integrates
# the eikonal Purkinje activation times into the monodomain myocardium solve.

# kind               key     metric          expected            tolerance
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node0   activationTime  0.00000000e+00      1e-6
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node8   activationTime  6.82346100e-03      1e-6
eikonalPurkinjeAT   node15  activationTime  8.32345950e-03      1e-6
